     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: MedicationKnowledge TiclopidinaGP-250mg-Comprimido-revestido-por-pelicula</b></p><a name=\"TiclopidinaGP-250mg-Comprimido-revestido-por-pelicula\"> </a><a name=\"hcTiclopidinaGP-250mg-Comprimido-revestido-por-pelicula\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #fbffeb; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-MedicationKnowledgePDH.html\">Perfil do recurso MedicationKnowledge - Recurso base informações de medicamento</a></p></div><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://infarmed.pt/medicamentos/prod_id 4644}\">Ticlopidina GP 250 mg [B01AC05]</span></p><p><b>name</b>: Ticlopidina GP [ticlopidina] 250 mg comprimido revestido por película</p><blockquote><p><b>indicationGuideline</b></p><h3>Indications</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Concept</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Redução do risco de ocorrência e recorrência de um acidente vascular cerebral, em doentes que sofreram acidente vascular cerebral isquémico constituído, acidente vascular cerebral menor, défice neurológico reversível de origem isquémica ou acidente isquémico transitório (AIT), incluindo cegueira unilateral transitória</span></td></tr></table><blockquote><p><b>dosingGuideline</b></p><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Posologia habitual</span></p><h3>Dosages</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Text</b></td><td><b>AdditionalInstruction</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>A posologia habitual é de dois comprimidos por dia, a tomar durante as refeições.</td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Os comprimidos devem ser ingeridos com água e sem mastigar.</span></td></tr></table></blockquote><h3>PatientCharacteristics</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Value[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Population</span></td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Adultos</span></td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>dosingGuideline</b></p><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Sem ajuste posológico</span></p><h3>Dosages</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Text</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>Embora a farmacocinética da ticlopidina se encontre alterada no idoso, a atividade farmacológica e terapêutica, na dose de 500 mg por dia, não é afetada pela idade.</td></tr></table></blockquote><h3>PatientCharacteristics</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Value[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Population</span></td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Utilização no idoso</span></td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>dosingGuideline</b></p><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Não indicado</span></p><h3>Dosages</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Text</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>Não se encontra indicado.</td></tr></table></blockquote><h3>PatientCharacteristics</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Value[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Population</span></td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Crianças</span></td></tr></table></blockquote></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>indicationGuideline</b></p><h3>Indications</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Concept</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Prevenç